    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d455-a2">

                <pb facs="0474" n="1208" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1208"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gunby to Mr.
                            Wolfe.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tampa, Fla.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: In the matter of the attachment and
                    information against the arms and ammunition recently seized near Cedar Keys, the
                    witnesses whose names you desire are S. B. Crosby and Harry Dolphin, both of
                    Tampa, Fla. Please let me know when the case will be called for trial, and
                    oblige,</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. R. Gunby.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
